---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';const {title,intro,points=[],boundary,cta='Talk to our team'}=Astro.props;
---
<Base title={title+' | ITKeepers'} description={intro}><section class="section"><p class="eyebrow">ITKeepers services</p><h1>{title}</h1><p class="lead">{intro}</p></section><section class="section light"><div class="split"><div><h2>What the team handles.</h2><p>{boundary}</p></div><div>{points.map((p)=><article><h3>{p[0]}</h3><p>{p[1]}</p></article>)}</div></div></section><slot /><section class="cta"><h2>Bring the context. We'll start there.</h2><p>Tell us what you are managing today and what needs attention.</p><a class="btn white" href="/contact">{cta} ↗</a></section></Base>
